@startuml 01-current-state
title Current State - Deployment Paths (Unstandardized)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FDF6EC
  BorderColor #C8A165
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #EEF3FA
  BorderColor #6B8CB8
}

actor "Team A\nEngineer" as A
actor "Team B\nEngineer" as B
actor "Team C\nEngineer" as C
actor "Platform\nAdmin" as PA

rectangle "Manual UI edits\n(no version control)" as UI
rectangle "Ad-hoc deploy scripts\n(per-team, unreviewed)" as SCRIPTS
rectangle "Personal access tokens\n(deploys run as individuals)" as PAT

cloud "Databricks Workspace" {
  rectangle "Jobs\n(unknown provenance)" as JOBS #FBE9E7
  rectangle "Apps\n(hand-deployed)" as APPS #FBE9E7
}

A --> UI
B --> SCRIPTS
C --> PAT
UI --> JOBS
SCRIPTS --> JOBS
SCRIPTS --> APPS
PAT --> APPS

PA .[#B71C1C].> JOBS : cannot audit\nwhat changed, when, by whom
PA .[#B71C1C].> APPS : no rollback path\nno promotion gates

note bottom of PA #FFF3F3
  **Risks carried today**
  * Prod changes with no review or history
  * Deploys tied to individuals (offboarding risk)
  * Every team reinvents its own process
  * Incidents are unreproducible
end note
@enduml
